  "id": "BIT-kyverno-2026-122304",
  "summary": "Kyverno 1.17.0 before 1.19.2 Privilege Escalation via CleanupPolicy Context Loader",
  "details": "Kyverno from 1.17.0 before 1.19.2 contains an authorization bypass vulnerability that allows namespace admins to escape namespace confinement because the cleanup controller builds its context loader with a nil policy. Attackers can create a namespaced CleanupPolicy with apiCall or globalReference context entries to read cross-namespace Secrets and modify validatingwebhookconfigurations using the cleanup controller's ServiceAccount.",
